{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人連敬涵於節目中推介富衛集團(1828)，指出公司近期公布業績，盈利與業務質素都顯著提升，而且多元化市場布局抵禦風險，股價回升也反映內地向保單收益徵稅，對集團影響有限。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RMiS7vScms1788418985.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4323.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">連敬涵建議32元買入，目標價上望38元，若失守29元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">富衛集團(1828)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$32</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$38</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$29</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Z50ZcdyrCh1788419029.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4324.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人趙晞文推介藥明康德(2359)，繼續採取跟進業績的選股策略，指公司季度業績勝預期，手上訂單也陸續增加，而且股價型態顯示仍屬強勢股，日前亦完成配股套現活動，對股價後續影響不大。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263llCWcPOti1788419044.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4325.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">趙晞文建議約185元便可以吸納，目標價看220元，止蝕價定於116元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藥明康德(2359)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$185</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$220</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$116</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026D2uR3EiwkL1788419063.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4326.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T07:44:05.802381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}